<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Results ‣ CE-Bench: Towards a Reliable Contrastive Evaluation Benchmark of Interpretability of Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Comparative Study: Proxy Learning vs. Simple Average Baseline</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS6" title="In 5 Results ‣ CE-Bench: Towards a Reliable Contrastive Evaluation Benchmark of Interpretability of Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.6 </span>Sample Score Visualization: Neuron-wise Contrastive Score and Independent Score</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In CE-Bench: Towards a Reliable Contrastive Evaluation Benchmark of Interpretability of Sparse Autoencoders" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
